2026-07-18 23:40:59,451 | INFO     | llm_service.py:177 | Sagar Rathod is a Fresher DevOps Engineer with hands-on experience in AWS cloud infrastructure, Linux administration, Docker containerization, and Kubernetes orchestration. He is skilled in DevOps automation, CI/CD pipeline implementation using Jenkins, Infrastructure as Code with Terraform, and monitoring cloud-native applications using CloudWatch and Grafana. Sagar is seeking an entry-level DevOps or Cloud Engineer role to support scalable, automated, and reliable systems. His technical skills include:

* Cloud Platforms: AWS (EC2, S3, RDS, IAM, VPC, ECR, CloudWatch)
* DevOps Tools: Docker, Kubernetes, Jenkins, CI/CD Pipelines
* Infrastructure as Code: Terraform
* Monitoring & Logging: CloudWatch, Prometheus, Grafana
* Scripting: Bash
* Version Control & Systems: Linux, Git, GitHub, Nginx

Sagar has experience as a DevOps Engineer Intern at Test Yantra Solutions, where he deployed and managed containerized applications using Docker and Kubernetes on AWS, implemented CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins, and provisioned and managed AWS infrastructure using Terraform.

