* Implemented CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins to automate build, test, and deployment workflows
* Provisioned and managed AWS infrastructure using Terraform (IaC)
* Configured monitoring, logging, and alerting using AWS CloudWatch and Grafana
* Troubleshot deployment and runtime issues through log analysis, metrics, and Kubernetes events
* Collaborated with development teams to support stable releases and DevOps automation practices

He also worked on several projects, including:
* Cloud-Native Backend Deployment: containerized Golang-based backend services using Docker and deployed them on AWS infrastructure
* 3-Tier Architecture Deployment on AWS: designed and deployed a scalable 3-tier architecture consisting of frontend, backend, and database layers on AWS
* Infrastructure Automation Lab: automated provisioning of AWS resources using Terraform and applied Infrastructure as Code (IaC) principles

