2026-07-19 00:09:14,709 | INFO     | llm_service.py:177 | Sagar is a fresher Golang Backend Engineer with strong hands-on project experience in building scalable REST APIs and microservices using Golang, PostgreSQL, and Redis. He has a solid understanding of clean architecture, concurrency, authentication, and backend system design. Sagar is familiar with deploying backend services on AWS using Docker and CI/CD. He is actively seeking an entry-level backend engineering role.

Some of his key technical skills include:
* Programming Languages: Golang, SQL, Bash
* Backend Development: RESTful APIs, Microservices Architecture, Clean Architecture, gRPC, JWT Authentication, Middleware, Concurrency (Goroutines, Channels)
* Databases: PostgreSQL (schema design, indexing), Redis (caching, sessions)
* Cloud: AWS (EC2, RDS, S3, IAM, VPC)
* DevOps & Tools: Docker, CI/CD (Jenkins), Git, GitHub, Linux, Postman

Sagar has experience as a DevOps Engineer Intern and has worked on several projects, including a Professional Verification Platform, a Matrimony Platform, and a Do Host Network project.

