2026-07-21 15:16:28,527 | INFO     | llm_service.py:177 | Sagar Rathod is a Backend Golang and Cloud DevOps Engineer with hands-on experience building scalable microservices and RESTful APIs using Golang (Gin), gRPC, PostgreSQL, and Redis. He has experience deploying cloud-native systems on AWS using Docker, Kubernetes (EKS), Terraform, and CI/CD pipelines, with a focus on scalability, security, and reliability. His technical skills include programming languages such as Golang, Bash, and SQL, as well as backend engineering, databases, cloud and DevOps, monitoring and observability, messaging and async, and security.

Some of his key experiences include:
* Deploying and managing Dockerized applications on AWS using Kubernetes, Linux, and Nginx
* Automating CI/CD pipelines and infrastructure provisioning using Jenkins and Terraform
* Delivering scalable Golang microservices and REST APIs for multiple clients, integrating PostgreSQL, Redis, Docker, and AWS services
* Building cloud-native solutions with CI/CD pipelines, Kubernetes deployments, monitoring, and secure authentication for production workloads

