2026-07-21 15:18:51,651 | INFO     | llm_service.py:177 | Sagar Rathod has experience as a Backend Golang and Cloud DevOps Engineer, with hands-on experience building scalable microservices and RESTful APIs using Golang, PostgreSQL, and Redis. He has deployed cloud-native systems on AWS using Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform, and CI/CD pipelines, focusing on scalability, security, and reliability. 

His experience includes:
* Deploying and managing Dockerized applications on AWS using Kubernetes, Linux, and Nginx
* Automating CI/CD pipelines and infrastructure provisioning using Jenkins and Terraform
* Delivering scalable Golang microservices and REST APIs for multiple clients, integrating PostgreSQL, Redis, Docker, and AWS services
* Building cloud-native solutions with CI/CD pipelines, Kubernetes deployments, monitoring, and secure authentication for production workloads

Sagar has worked on various projects, including:
* Professional Verification Platform: designing and implementing scalable Golang microservices using REST and gRPC APIs, JWT authentication, PostgreSQL, and Redis
* Matrimony Platform: building Golang microservices with REST APIs, WebSockets, JWT authentication, PostgreSQL, and Redis
* Do Host Network: developing a monolithic backend using Golang with PostgreSQL, implementing concurrency patterns for reliable and high-throughput services

