2026-07-21 15:22:09,308 | INFO     | llm_service.py:177 | Sagar Rathod is a Backend Golang and Cloud DevOps Engineer with hands-on experience building scalable microservices and RESTful APIs using Golang (Gin), gRPC, PostgreSQL, and Redis. He has experience in deploying cloud-native systems on AWS using Docker, Kubernetes (EKS), Terraform, and CI/CD pipelines, with a focus on scalability, security, and reliability. 

His experience includes:
* Deploying and managing Dockerized applications on AWS using Kubernetes, Linux, and Nginx
* Automating CI/CD pipelines and infrastructure provisioning using Jenkins and Terraform
* Delivering scalable Golang microservices and REST APIs for multiple clients, integrating PostgreSQL, Redis, Docker, and AWS services
* Building cloud-native solutions with CI/CD pipelines, Kubernetes deployments, monitoring, and secure authentication for production workloads
* Implementing real-time features using WebSockets and optimizing backend systems for high concurrency and reliability

He has worked on various projects, including:
* Professional Verification Platform: Designed and implemented scalable Golang microservices using REST and gRPC APIs, JWT authentication, PostgreSQL, and Redis
* Matrimony Platform: Built Golang microservices for a matrimony platform with REST APIs, WebSockets, JWT authentication, PostgreSQL, and Redis
* Do Host Network: Developed a monolithic backend using Golang (Gin) with PostgreSQL, implementing concurrency patterns for reliable and high-throughput services

